                    <div class="stat-label">Years surgeon experience (top hospitals)</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- SECTION 2: Cost Comparison -->
            <h2>Section 2: Cost Comparison — The Numbers That Make You Look Twice</h2>

            <p>Let's talk money. Knee replacement surgery in China costs 70-80% less than in Western countries. Same implants. Same surgical techniques. Often the same surgeons trained at Johns Hopkins or Mayo Clinic.</p>

            <table class="cost-table">
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>Location</th>
                        <th>Single Knee Replacement</th>
                        <th>Double Knee Replacement</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    <tr>
                        <td><strong>United States</strong></td>
                        <td>$35,000 - $60,000</td>
                        <td>$60,000 - $100,000</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td><strong>United Kingdom (Private)</strong></td>
                        <td>£25,000 - £35,000</td>
