                        <td><strong>China (Top Hospitals)</strong></td>
                        <td><strong>$8,000 - $15,000</strong></td>
                        <td><strong>$14,000 - $25,000</strong></td>
                    </tr>
                </tbody>
            </table>

            <div class="highlight">
                <strong>What's included in Chinese hospital packages:</strong>
                <ul style="margin: 15px 0 0 20px;">
                    <li>Pre-operative consultations and imaging</li>
                    <li>Surgery with imported implants (Zimmer, Stryker, or DePuy)</li>
                    <li>5-7 days hospital stay</li>
                    <li>Post-operative physiotherapy</li>
                    <li>English-speaking coordinators</li>
                    <li>Airport transfers and accommodation assistance</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <!-- SECTION 3: Top Hospitals -->
            <h2>Section 3: Top 5 Hospitals for Knee Replacement in China</h2>

