                <p><strong>Specialties:</strong> Complex revision surgeries, robotic-assisted knee replacement, minimally invasive techniques</p>

                <p><strong>Cost range:</strong> $12,000 - $18,000 per knee</p>

                <p><strong>International department:</strong> Full English support, dedicated international patient coordinators, direct billing with major insurers</p>
            </div>

