            <!-- SECTION 4: Cost Breakdown (NEW) -->
            <h2>Section 4: Cost Breakdown — Exactly Where Your Money Goes</h2>

            <p>Understanding the cost structure helps you compare apples-to-apples when evaluating hospital packages. Here's a detailed breakdown of what contributes to the $8,000-$15,000 knee replacement cost in China:</p>

            <h3>Single Knee Replacement Cost Components</h3>

