            </table>

            <div class="highlight-box">
                <h3>Why implants cost less in China</h3>
                <p>China's top hospitals purchase implants directly from manufacturers at wholesale prices. In the US, the same implant might be marked up 200-400% by the hospital and distributor before reaching the patient. Chinese hospitals pass these savings onto international patients.</p>

                <p><strong>Same brands, same quality:</strong> Zimmer Biomet, Stryker, DePuy Synthes, and Smith & Nephew all have FDA approval and CE marking. The implants in a Chinese hospital are identical to those used in Western hospitals.</p>
            </div>

