                    <li>Hospital remains available for remote consultation via email/video</li>
                    <li>Digital copies of all records accessible via patient portal</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="highlight-box">
                <h3>Risk 7: Post-Discharge Complications While Flying</h3>
                <p><strong>Mitigation:</strong></p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Surgeon must clear patient for air travel (typically Day 14+)</li>
                    <li>Compression stockings mandatory during flight</li>
                    <li> aisle seats recommended for mobility</li>
                    <li>Short layovers suggested to reduce sitting time</li>
                    <li>Travel insurance with medical evacuation coverage recommended</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <h3>Red Flags — When to Choose a Different Option</h3>
            <p><strong>Consider alternatives to surgery in China if:</strong></p>
            <ul>
